#!/bin/sh
# FerrumOS Zapret NFQWS DPI Circumvention Service
# Restores YouTube 4K playback and Discord voice/media in Russia without VPN
# Ensures zero packet loss and preserves all QUIC/UDP (Hysteria 2 / TUIC) traffic

NFQWS="/usr/bin/nfqws"
QNUM=200

flush_zapret_rules() {
    # Thoroughly flush all duplicate rules until iptables -D returns non-zero
    while iptables -D FORWARD -p udp --dport 443 -j REJECT --reject-with icmp-port-unreachable 2>/dev/null; do :; done
    while iptables -D FORWARD -p udp --dport 443 -j REJECT 2>/dev/null; do :; done
    while iptables -D FORWARD -p udp --dport 443 -j DROP 2>/dev/null; do :; done
    while iptables -D FORWARD -p udp --dport 443 -j ACCEPT 2>/dev/null; do :; done
    while iptables -t mangle -D POSTROUTING -p udp --dport 443 -j DROP 2>/dev/null; do :; done
    while iptables -t mangle -D PREROUTING -p udp --dport 443 -j DROP 2>/dev/null; do :; done
    while iptables -t filter -D INPUT -p udp --dport 443 -j DROP 2>/dev/null; do :; done
    while iptables -t mangle -D POSTROUTING -p tcp -m multiport --dports 80,443 -j ZAPRET_NFQ 2>/dev/null; do :; done
    while iptables -t mangle -D POSTROUTING -p tcp -m multiport --dports 80,443 -m connbytes --connbytes-dir=original --connbytes-mode=packets --connbytes 1:6 -j NFQUEUE --queue-num $QNUM --queue-bypass 2>/dev/null; do :; done
    while iptables -t mangle -D POSTROUTING -p tcp -m multiport --dports 80,443 -m connbytes --connbytes-dir=original --connbytes-mode=packets --connbytes 1:6 -j NFQUEUE --queue-num $QNUM 2>/dev/null; do :; done
    while iptables -t mangle -D POSTROUTING -p udp --dport 50000:65535 -j ZAPRET_NFQ 2>/dev/null; do :; done
    while iptables -t mangle -D POSTROUTING -p udp --dport 50000:65535 -m connbytes --connbytes-dir=original --connbytes-mode=packets --connbytes 1:6 -j NFQUEUE --queue-num $QNUM --queue-bypass 2>/dev/null; do :; done
    while iptables -t mangle -D POSTROUTING -p udp --dport 50000:65535 -j NFQUEUE --queue-num $QNUM 2>/dev/null; do :; done
    while iptables -t mangle -D POSTROUTING -p udp --dport 50000:50099 -j ZAPRET_NFQ 2>/dev/null; do :; done
    while iptables -t mangle -D POSTROUTING -p udp --dport 50000:50099 -m connbytes --connbytes-dir=original --connbytes-mode=packets --connbytes 1:6 -j NFQUEUE --queue-num $QNUM --queue-bypass 2>/dev/null; do :; done
    iptables -t mangle -F ZAPRET_NFQ 2>/dev/null || true
    iptables -t mangle -X ZAPRET_NFQ 2>/dev/null || true
}

start_zapret() {
    echo "[FerrumOS] Starting Zapret NFQWS DPI bypass..."

    # Ensure required Netfilter modules are loaded
    modprobe xt_NFQUEUE 2>/dev/null || true
    modprobe xt_connbytes 2>/dev/null || true
    modprobe xt_multiport 2>/dev/null || true

    # Disable hardware NAT offload bypass so Netfilter NFQUEUE sees packets 1:6
    echo 0 > /proc/sys/net/nat/fast_nat 2>/dev/null || true
    rmmod hw_nat 2>/dev/null || true

    # Kill any existing nfqws process to prevent duplicate instances on qnum 200
    killall nfqws 2>/dev/null || true
    sleep 1

    # Clean old iptables rules to prevent duplicate entries
    flush_zapret_rules

    # Explicitly guarantee UDP 443 is ACCEPTED in FORWARD chain
    # This prevents any downstream firewall rules from dropping Hysteria 2 / QUIC VPN from phones and PCs!
    iptables -I FORWARD -p udp --dport 443 -j ACCEPT

    # Create dedicated ZAPRET_NFQ chain
    iptables -t mangle -N ZAPRET_NFQ 2>/dev/null || iptables -t mangle -F ZAPRET_NFQ

    # Return on LAN and private subnets
    iptables -t mangle -A ZAPRET_NFQ -d 127.0.0.0/8 -j RETURN
    iptables -t mangle -A ZAPRET_NFQ -d 192.168.0.0/16 -j RETURN
    iptables -t mangle -A ZAPRET_NFQ -d 10.0.0.0/8 -j RETURN
    iptables -t mangle -A ZAPRET_NFQ -d 172.16.0.0/12 -j RETURN

    # GUARANTEE UDP 443 (Hysteria 2 / QUIC / TUIC) IS NEVER TOUCHED OR DESYNCED BY NFQUEUE
    iptables -t mangle -A ZAPRET_NFQ -p udp --dport 443 -j RETURN

    # Explicit bypass for all external VPN client ports and IP protocols
    iptables -t mangle -A ZAPRET_NFQ -p udp -m multiport --dports 500,1194,1701,4500,51820,41641,9993 -j RETURN
    iptables -t mangle -A ZAPRET_NFQ -p 50 -j RETURN
    iptables -t mangle -A ZAPRET_NFQ -p 51 -j RETURN
    iptables -t mangle -A ZAPRET_NFQ -p 47 -j RETURN

    # Return on VPN / Tunnel marks (0x100 for VLESS, 0x40000000 for kernel tunnels)
    iptables -t mangle -A ZAPRET_NFQ -m mark --mark 0x100/0x100 -j RETURN
    iptables -t mangle -A ZAPRET_NFQ -m mark --mark 0x40000000/0x40000000 -j RETURN

    # Bypass remote proxy server destination IP so tunnel packets never get desynced
    if [ -f /etc/sing-box/proxy_server.txt ]; then
        PROXY_SRV="$(cat /etc/sing-box/proxy_server.txt)"
        [ -n "$PROXY_SRV" ] && iptables -t mangle -A ZAPRET_NFQ -d "$PROXY_SRV" -j RETURN
    fi

    # Pass initial TCP SYN/ClientHello packets (packets 1:6) to NFQUEUE with queue-bypass
    iptables -t mangle -A ZAPRET_NFQ -p tcp -m connbytes --connbytes-dir=original --connbytes-mode=packets --connbytes 1:6 -j NFQUEUE --queue-num $QNUM --queue-bypass

    # Check if Discord voice fix is active in config (defaults to true)
    DC_FIX=1
    if [ -f /etc/storage/zapret_config.json ]; then
        if grep -q '"discord_fix": false' /etc/storage/zapret_config.json 2>/dev/null; then
            DC_FIX=0
        fi
    elif [ -f /etc/zapret_config.json ]; then
        if grep -q '"discord_fix": false' /etc/zapret_config.json 2>/dev/null; then
            DC_FIX=0
        fi
    fi

    # Only forward Discord Voice WebRTC UDP (ports 50000:50099) if enabled, and limit to packets 1:6
    # NARROWED FROM 50000:65535 SO WIREGUARD (51820) AND HYSTERIA HIGH PORTS ARE NEVER TOUCHED
    if [ "$DC_FIX" = "1" ]; then
        iptables -t mangle -A ZAPRET_NFQ -p udp --dport 50000:50099 -m connbytes --connbytes-dir=original --connbytes-mode=packets --connbytes 1:6 -j NFQUEUE --queue-num $QNUM --queue-bypass
    fi

    # Hook ZAPRET_NFQ into POSTROUTING for TCP 80,443 and (if enabled) UDP 50000:50099
    iptables -t mangle -I POSTROUTING -p tcp -m multiport --dports 80,443 -j ZAPRET_NFQ
    if [ "$DC_FIX" = "1" ]; then
        iptables -t mangle -I POSTROUTING -p udp --dport 50000:50099 -j ZAPRET_NFQ
    fi

    # Locate nfqws binary
    [ ! -x "$NFQWS" ] && [ -x /usr/sbin/nfqws ] && NFQWS="/usr/sbin/nfqws"
    [ ! -x "$NFQWS" ] && [ -x /tmp/nfqws ] && NFQWS="/tmp/nfqws"

    if [ ! -x "$NFQWS" ]; then
        echo "[FerrumOS] Error: nfqws binary not found. Cannot start Zapret."
        exit 1
    fi

    # Launch nfqws with selected strategy preset (or custom args)
    ARGS="--qnum=$QNUM --dpi-desync=fake,split2 --dpi-desync-split-pos=1 --dpi-desync-fooling=badseq --dpi-desync-cutoff=d4 --dpi-desync-repeats=2 --bind-fix4"
    if [ -f /etc/zapret/nfqws.args ]; then
        ARGS="$(cat /etc/zapret/nfqws.args)"
    elif [ -f /etc/storage/zapret/nfqws.args ]; then
        ARGS="$(cat /etc/storage/zapret/nfqws.args)"
    fi

    # Start nfqws daemon with pidfile
    $NFQWS $ARGS --pidfile=/var/run/nfqws.pid --daemon

    echo "[FerrumOS] Zapret active: YouTube 4K and Discord voice unblocked without dropping UDP 443 / Hysteria."
}

stop_zapret() {
    echo "[FerrumOS] Stopping Zapret..."
    killall nfqws 2>/dev/null || true
    flush_zapret_rules
}

case "$1" in
    start) start_zapret ;;
    stop) stop_zapret ;;
    restart) stop_zapret; sleep 1; start_zapret ;;
    *) echo "Usage: $0 {start|stop|restart}"; exit 1 ;;
esac
